oomble will reign supreme when the timer hits zero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you dominate matches, you'll unlock exciting customization options, like flashy colors, quirky hats, and stylish accessories to give your Boomble personality. Whether you prefer a wizard look or a hilarious cowboy vibe, your Boomble will stand out as you conquer the leaderboard.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381030/extras/ab5f04cc897a6f2ad6c0157aecb45608.avif?t=1767368023\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381030/extras_big/ab5f04cc897a6f2ad6c0157aecb45608.avif?t=1767368023 width=800 height=450 /></span><strong>Hungry</strong> isn\u2019t just a game, it\u2019s a fast-paced, adrenaline-fueled competition where every bite counts. Will you rise to the top or get devoured trying? There\u2019s only one way to find out: grab your Boomble, and let the feast begin!</p>","developers":["Quiphainyr Entertainment"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381030/734236df7e7a4b19f5880967dc4db120e6bf0b72/header.jpg?t=1767368023","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3381030/156605781/a4877910016a691e06cd11fa9b2c667fce2fff08/1762283465/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762284376","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3381030/156605781/a4877910016a691e06cd11fa9b2c667fce2fff08/1762283465/dash_h264.mpd?t=17622843